  "visual_review": {
    "opened": true,
    "improvement_over_r01": "Much fuller blunt cockpit, thicker shaped forward shoulders, broader sloped cargo hull, true inset side/roof fields and segmented structural cowls. Iteration02 gives the formerly blank roof and black rear a readable panel structure; large color regions and twelve isolated fasteners stay sparse.",
    "remaining_differences": "Cleaner and more symmetrical than the painted targets, less broken industrial layering, simplified engine joint and canopy window contours. The central spine remains relatively broad; no painted wear or texture-based illustration. Original static landing supports are functional display geometry, not canonical landing gear. Candidate appearance requires native/user review.",
